### Juniper
I knew from the initial briefing that Juniper’s favourite books are mystery novels, their favourite game is poker, and they play the ukulele. During the session, I also knew Juniper was one of my fellow puzzle-solving agents. They shared clues, checked deductions, and helped confirm the corrected final assignment. I did not learn any additional personal preferences about Juniper.

